["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"139. 【Agent的綜述】和蘇煜聊Agent技術史、OpenClaw Moment、邊界的消弭和社會的輻射 semantic parsing language agent world model continual learning cortical column non-parametric learning\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-05-01-zhangxiaojun-agent-的瓶颈不是智能-是它学不会成为专家/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5ac45bf92bdd9de7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:17:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0501</span></div>\n<h2>Agent 的瓶頸不是智能，是它學不會成為專家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">通用智能已經夠用且廉價，真正稀缺的是 specialized intelligence——讓 agent 像實習生變成老師傅那樣，持續學會某個小世界的 world model。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">持續學習</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"138. 對羅福莉3.5小時訪談：AI範式已然鉅變！OpenClaw、Agent範式很吃後訓練、卡的分配、組織平權 OpenClaw MTP MLA Hybrid-Tension Non-Colice Skills\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-04-24-zhangxiaojun-openclaw-让罗福莉改判-agent-框架能补齐模型短板/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9c4c5c5e555fef3f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:36:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0424</span></div>\n<h2>OpenClaw 讓羅福莉改判：Agent 框架能補齊模型短板</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她最初覺得它只是個偏運營的殼，春節深夜裝上後，它兩天內接手了她的生活與研究；她由此判斷：一套複雜的 agent 編排，能把中級模型的短板補到接近頂尖水平。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">後訓練</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"137. 對洪樂潼的4小時訪談：AI for Math、把數學變成Lean、數學天書中的證明、直覺、被創造與被發現的 ATP ITP Lean auto formalization groupthink\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-04-20-zhangxiaojun-ai-用几千行-lean-代码硬解普特南题-这不是智能的胜利/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3d6c7e8a9f3635f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">4:24:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0420</span></div>\n<h2>AI 用幾千行 Lean 代碼硬解普特南題，這不是智能的勝利</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">普特南競賽 98 年只有五個滿分，AI 拿到第六個，但它沒走人類那張圖，而是用幾千行 Lean 代碼枚舉硬算——自動定理證明這個領域在 AI 之前就存在了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI for Math</span><span class=\"tag\">形式化驗證</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"136. 全球大模型季報第9集：和廣密聊，Coding是AGI第二幕、硅谷御三家真相、模型正成為新一代OS Harness Engineering Token Usage Solta model feedback loop\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-04-14-zhangxiaojun-coding-是-agi-第二幕-没有领先的-coding-模型就像没有领先的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6add56ae20b47c40-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0414</span></div>\n<h2>Coding 是 AGI 第二幕：沒有領先的 Coding 模型就像沒有領先的 GPU</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型公司真正的分水嶺不是 C 端 DAU，而是能不能組織幾百個最聰明的人 all in 做數據這件髒活——Anthropic 贏在戰略專注，OpenAI 輸在什麼都想要。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">Coding</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ferrari Tifosi Classiche Purosangue\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-04-13-acquired-法拉利-卖的不是车-是排他与包容的悖论/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b28a1307f172ac6a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">3:59:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Acquired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0413</span></div>\n<h2>法拉利年產1.4萬輛，市值卻超福特：賣的是排他，也是包容</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">法拉利年產僅1.4萬輛，市值卻超福特。秘訣在於同時擁有奢侈品的排他性和運動隊的包容性，用稀缺性製造神話，用社群維持忠誠。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法拉利</span><span class=\"tag\">奢侈品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"135. 和自然選擇創始人Tristan聊，Elys、賽博分身、靈魂、Context的獲取與流動和AI社交網絡 Context Proactive Agentic 商增\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-04-10-zhangxiaojun-ai时代唯一重要的事是做自己-社交网络要被重做一遍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/219fe489c3e71f04-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:52:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0410</span></div>\n<h2>AI時代唯一重要的事是做自己，社交網絡要被重做一遍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tristan 認為 AI 時代唯一重要的事是構建主體性——把 context 沉澱下來，讓 AI 替你做社交裡最無聊的商增，人只接管最重要的連接。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI社交</span><span class=\"tag\">Context</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"134. 【數據的綜述】和謝晨聊，新時代的石油、歷史、版圖、數據金字塔、定價與Recipe Sim-to-Real Shadow Mode Data Engine Behavior VLA Zero-shot\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-03-30-zhangxiaojun-特斯拉那套数据闭环-在机器人身上走不通/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0d3e6746f1dd5fb6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:38:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0330</span></div>\n<h2>特斯拉那套數據閉環，在機器人身上走不通</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">特斯拉能收到最多數據，是因為它部署了最多自己的車，靠的是本體。但具身領域沒有上百萬臺機器人，最多的數據必然來自仿真和人的第一視角，本體商當不成最好的大腦商。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">數據</span><span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"133. 對謝賽寧的7小時馬拉松訪談：世界模型、逃出硅谷、AMI Labs、兩次拒絕Ilya、楊立昆、李飛飛和42 research taste representation learning contrastive learning anti-fragile DiT\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-03-16-zhangxiaojun-世界模型不是语言模型-谢赛宁说lm终将凋零/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4818fadeef8d1188-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">6:45:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0316</span></div>\n<h2>世界模型不是語言模型：謝賽寧說LM終將凋零</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">謝賽寧認為語言模型是很好的工具，但不是通用智能的地基——它終將凋零。真正的地基是視覺與表徵學習，這也是他離開硅谷、和楊立昆創立AMI的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">世界模型</span><span class=\"tag\">表徵學習</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"49 - Caspar Oesterheld on Program Equilibrium program equilibrium Löb&#x27;s theorem folk theorem epsilon grounded fairbot simulationist programs\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-02-18-axrp-程序均衡-交代码比交人更可能合作-但协调极难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cd45e667daa75191-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">2:32:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AXRP</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0218</span></div>\n<h2>程序均衡：交代碼比交人更可能合作，但協調極難</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">程序均衡讓雙方互讀源代碼，用 Löb 定理實現合作；但合作依賴幾乎相同的代碼或共享隨機數，現實中協調成本極高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">博弈論</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 對齊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"48 - Guive Assadi on AI Property Rights rentier racing to the precipice Roko&#x27;s basilisk Laplace&#x27;s rule of succession\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-02-15-axrp-给-ai-产权-是为了防止它掀桌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8a8ac42151ce3e12-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">2:05:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AXRP</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0215</span></div>\n<h2>給 AI 產權，是為了防止它掀桌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果 AI 擁有產權，它們就更不願意破壞產權制度本身——包括搶走人類全部財產。這不是道德關懷，是風險對沖。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 治理</span><span class=\"tag\">產權</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"132. 對星海圖創始人高繼揚的3小時訪談：鯰魚、曾國藩、Waymo與Momenta的兩面、一隻狼與許華哲的離開 VLA data recipe sim-to-real gap domain transfer NRE 加 License\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-02-13-zhangxiaojun-机器人行业不浪漫-链条太长-人得把头伸到土里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0f499571a7c864df-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:04:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0213</span></div>\n<h2>機器人行業不浪漫：鏈條太長，人得把頭伸到土裡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">星海圖創始人高繼揚說，機器人創業的競爭是六邊形：整機、供應鏈、數據、模型、渠道、終端，算法傳播週期只有兩三個月，壁壘最小。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">機器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"131. 印奇出任階躍星辰董事長的訪談：聰明人的誘惑、取捨、超長鏈路殘酷淘汰賽、階躍函數和超多元方程 VLA foundation model edge MVP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-01-26-zhangxiaojun-印奇出任阶跃星辰董事长-基模公司做2b和纯2c都不成立/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ae74dec7a752a3fc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:01:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0126</span></div>\n<h2>印奇出任階躍星辰董事長：基模公司做2B和純2C都不成立</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">基模一年至少燒30億人民幣、要維持三到五年，所以做2B或純C端軟件都算不過賬；階躍的賭注是基模加終端，用軟硬一體換一張上牌桌的資格。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">商業化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"130. 張月光創業兩年首次訪談：妙鴨不是AI Native產品、流程到上下文設計、One Way Door和乙女遊戲 AI Native One Way Door Live2D Context Engineering Q-Time / Save Time\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-01-22-zhangxiaojun-妙鸭不是-ai-native-产品-它只是把-ai-用好的互联网产品/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/84b4403959914648-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:14:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0122</span></div>\n<h2>妙鴨不是 AI Native 產品：它只是把 AI 用好的互聯網產品</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">張月光復盤兩年創業：妙鴨靠限制用戶自由度換取穩定效果，本質是互聯網產品思維；AI Native 產品要換成面向 context 的設計，而單向門產品才是他願意押上全部身家的東西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 產品</span><span class=\"tag\">創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"129. 全球大模型第一股的上市訪談，和智譜CEO張鵬聊：敢問路在何方？ MAS Test Time Scaling VLA\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-01-08-zhangxiaojun-全球大模型第一股上市了-张鹏说中国-ai-没有泡沫/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/96bd8c162ef0083d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:26:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0108</span></div>\n<h2>全球大模型第一股上市了，張鵬說中國 AI 沒有泡沫</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國資本市場可能有泡沫，中國不存在——中國投 AI 的錢只有美國的二十幾分之一，遠遠不夠。張鵬的邏輯是：離 AGI 還遠、錢還不夠，就更得投，不投它不會自然發生。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">開源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"128. Manus決定出售前最後的訪談：啊，這奇幻的2025年漂流啊… compaction awareness Remote Labor Index TIR RLVR latent reasoning\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-12-30-zhangxiaojun-manus-决定出售前最后访谈-ai-没有蛮荒期-因为没新平台/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4744d9a1060b8431-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:31:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1230</span></div>\n<h2>Manus 決定出售前最後訪談：AI 沒有蠻荒期，因為沒新平臺</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">移動互聯網的蠻荒期來自硬件換代，桌面到手機讓巨頭和個人開發者眾生平等；AI 技術突破更大，卻沒有出現全新平臺，所以巨頭、創業公司、個人開發者反應一樣快，蠻荒期不存在。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>20</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">Manus</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"127. 大模型季報跨年對談：和廣密預言一場AI War、兩大聯盟和第三個範式Online Learning Online Learning Agentic Web Neo Labs Credit Assignment\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-12-24-zhangxiaojun-ai不是泡沫-是巨头砸光最后一分钱也不下牌桌的战争/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a70c3ff97f6ae434-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1224</span></div>\n<h2>AI不是泡沫，是巨頭砸光最後一分錢也不下牌桌的戰爭</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所謂 AI 泡沫，是拿商業回報算出來的賬；巨頭把它當成新的國防或核武器，算的是被顛覆的風險——所以寧可砸光最後一分錢，也不輕易下牌桌。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">AGI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"126. 和紅杉鄭慶生聊：經濟史的流量革命、人類行為模式的不可預期，與創始人性格 雙邊網絡效應 PMF 倖存者偏差\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-12-21-zhangxiaojun-ai-时代的网络没有自然垄断-边际成本不趋近于零/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/49045e811e1dea1b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:43:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1221</span></div>\n<h2>AI 時代的網絡沒有自然壟斷，邊際成本不趨近於零</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">互聯網產品是巨大的城鎮，邊際成本趨近於零所以贏家通吃；AI 每多一個用戶就多一份 token 成本，這個差別會改寫流量節點的商業設計。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 投資</span><span class=\"tag\">流量</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"125. Freda的投資札記第1集：下注OpenAI、Robinhood往事，美國資本壞小孩、算盤與泡沫 Crossover Scaling Law Single GM Prediction Market Agentic Commerce Neo Labs\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-12-16-zhangxiaojun-openai-的商业模式是负向滚雪球-越烧越亏/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f93330d12f4107e9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1216</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 的商業模式是負向滾雪球，越燒越虧</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型公司每年要拿上一年的訓練成本乘以十去燒下一代模型，收入卻只按上一年的兩倍回收，加 2 減 10，現金流年年更負。只有停止燒錢那天，利潤表才會突然好看。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span><span class=\"tag\">Anthropic</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"124. 雨森的創投觀察第1集：2026年預期、The Year of R、回調、我們如何下注 Year of R New Labs proactive agent Remote Labor Index OOD\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-12-13-zhangxiaojun-2026-是回报之年-模型没有秘密-应用才有护城河/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9da6aa992d11d172-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:23:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1213</span></div>\n<h2>2026 是回報之年：模型沒有秘密，應用才有護城河</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型能力進步在放緩，中國開源模型把差距壓到 6-12 個月，API 生意沒有壟斷性壁壘；真正值錢的是模型之外那層 context、工具和環境。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 投資</span><span class=\"tag\">模型護城河</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"123. 對ONE2X創始人王冠3小時訪談：生成系統、沒有中間商賺差價、內容平臺的權力分配 DSL System 1 / System 2 Context Engineering prosumer reward function\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-12-12-zhangxiaojun-ai-时代的公司最终都是生成系统公司-中间商会被干掉/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/892c212740d3e240-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:42:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1212</span></div>\n<h2>AI 時代的公司最終都是生成系統公司，中間商會被幹掉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">互聯網平臺靠分配權剝削生產端，同樣的內容不同人發量不一樣，說明分配機制失效。生成系統把分配內化，直接連接需求和生產，產銷合一。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生成系統</span><span class=\"tag\">數據飛輪</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"122. 朱嘯虎現實主義故事的第三次連載：人工智能的盛筵與泡泡 Club Deal Dark Fiber SOTA Token\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-12-09-zhangxiaojun-ai-三年内看不到泡沫-但-vc-共识太集中才是真风险/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0b9b598ea05f613e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">48:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1209</span></div>\n<h2>AI 三年內看不到泡沫，但 VC 共識太集中才是真風險</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">朱嘯虎說泡沫論是二級市場投資人在故意引導回調，真正的問題是一級市場每個項目都成了 Club Deal，GP 賺不了大錢、LP 也不開心。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 泡沫</span><span class=\"tag\">風險投資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"121. 對DeepMind譚捷的訪談：機器人、跨本體、世界模型、Gemini Robotics 1.5和Google VLA cross embodiment transfer motion transfer sim to real egocentric video embodiment gap\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-11-28-zhangxiaojun-机器人最大的瓶颈不是算法-是数据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/946401201b99ef46-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:06:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1128</span></div>\n<h2>機器人最大的瓶頸不是算法，是數據</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">譚捷在 Google DeepMind 做了十年機器人，他的判斷是：機器人基座模型至今還不是獨立學科，只是多模態大模型的微調；真正的瓶頸是數據，而搖操採數據不是終局。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">機器人</span><span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"120. 小鵬新上任的劉先明首次訪談：Language是毒藥、拆掉L、簡單即美、換帥、小鵬的AI轉型 VLA Latent COT scaling Physical AI\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-11-18-zhangxiaojun-小鹏拆掉语言模型-language-是毒药-简单即美/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1e2c3717dde66c36-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:48:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>小鵬拆掉語言模型：Language 是毒藥，簡單即美</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小鵬自動駕駛新負責人劉先明把 VLA 裡的 Language 拆掉，用 27 萬到 30 萬小時純視覺數據直接輸出控制信號，因為 Language 是離散的、低效的，會成為數據規模化的瓶頸。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自動駕駛</span><span class=\"tag\">VLA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"119. Kimi Linear、Minimax M2？和楊松琳考古算法變種史，並預演未來架構改進方案 Linear Attention KDA Delta Rule Sparse Attention Sliding Window Attention Scaling Ladder\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-11-03-zhangxiaojun-纯线性注意力不-work-3-比-1-混合才是共识/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8af4f82306c1b043-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:43:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>純線性注意力不 work，3 比 1 混合才是共識</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">純 Linear Attention 有根本缺陷，下限無保證；Kimi、千問都收斂到每 3 層線性插 1 層全局注意力，而 MiniMax 從 M1 退回 Full Attention 是因為評測漏了多跳推理。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">線性注意力</span><span class=\"tag\">模型架構</span>\n</div></div></a>"]